            <ArticleTitle>[Professor LUO Cai-gui's experience of using acupoint &quot;Baliao&quot; for treatment of low back pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1225-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Professor LUO Cai-gui's experience of acupuncture at acupoint &quot;Baliao&quot; with twisting manipulation for treatment of low back pain is introduced. This method has significant efficacy on improving low back pain and numbness of lower extremities, which is characterized with short-time manipulation, quick de-qi and long effective time. The acupuncture methods, manipulations, precautions, etc. are elaborated in details. A typical case is added.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
